&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;I have provided four poseable guardsmen and their standard issue lasguns and hellguns. These are print friendly and only need a program such as blender, maya, motionbuilder or 3ds max along with several other options to pose.
